      "comment" : "Part of the footer of an idle session's preview in the popover: number of subagents whose end was never reported. Joined with the other parts by a separator the view draws, e.g. \"13 done | 2 lost contact\". Also on the button that opens a session row's subagent list, e.g. \"Subagents 1 working · 3 done · 2 lost contact\".",
