    "%lld need you" : {
      "comment" : "Number of a session's subagents waiting for the user to allow a tool call or to answer a question, at any depth. On the line under a session's row in the popover that opens its subagent list, after the working ones, e.g. \"Subagents 2 working · 1 needs you\"; also in an idle session's preview footer, e.g. \"3 subagents · 1 needs you · 2 done\". Also counts sessions, not subagents, where the English text leaves \"sessions\" out as the context says it: in the tooltip of \"◆ n\" on the popover's Active tab, the number of sessions in which anyone waits for the user.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
