    "Never" : {
      "comment" : "Settings window, last entry of two popups. Sessions: the popup that sets when a session moves to the Idle group; keeps every session at the top. Notifications: the popup that sets how long a turn must have lasted for its end to notify; no turn's end notifies. Also the Menu Bar pane: radio button of \"Animate the icon\" that keeps the menu bar icon still in every state.",
