    "Some may have finished since." : {
      "comment" : "Popover, last line of the tooltip of the \"Shell\" line on a session's row while several shell commands the agent started in the background may still run, under the shells listed at the last turn end: the list is not live. Also read by VoiceOver as the end of the row's hint.",
      "localizations" : {
