    "The marketplace is already there. Runs %lld command in your login shell. subspace adds hooks that run in every %@ session." : {
      "comment" : "Setup window, card of one coding tool, box of terminal commands the card can run for the user, footer before the Install button is pressed, when the plugin marketplace was added before. The first argument is the number of commands that will run, the second the tool's name, e.g. \"Claude Code\". \"subspace\" is a product name, do not translate it.",
