    "This version of The Collective needs subspace %@ or later. You have %@, so some events from %@ sessions won’t show up." : {
      "comment" : "Setup window, card of one coding tool: text under the header while the installed subspace plugin is older than this app needs. The first argument is the oldest version that works, e.g. \"1.1.0\", the second the installed one, e.g. \"1.0.1\", the third the tool's name, e.g. \"Claude Code\". \"The Collective\" is the app's name and \"subspace\" a product name, do not translate them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
