    "Try again: runs %@" : {
      "comment" : "Setup window, card of one coding tool, box of terminal commands the card can run for the user, accessibility label of the Try Again button. The argument is the failed command it runs again, kept as is. Also the label of the settings window's update group's Try Again button, where it reruns a single-line update in full (the argument is then the command it runs).",
