    "Try again: runs %@, then %@" : {
      "comment" : "Settings window, pane of one coding tool, group \"Update\" under the subspace row, shown while the installed subspace plugin should be updated: accessibility label of the Try Again button after every update command finished but the new version didn't show up, so all of them run again. The arguments are the commands it runs, kept as is: all but the last, then the last.",
